---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Prashant Kumar" description="Privacy information for kumarprashant.net.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Simple site. Minimal data.</h1>
      <p class="lede">This site is designed to collect as little personal information as practical.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container brand-columns">
      <div>
        <h2>What that means.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>The site does not use advertising trackers and I do not sell personal information.</p>
        <p>This site is hosted and protected by Cloudflare. Like most hosting and security platforms, Cloudflare may process technical request, performance and security information needed to deliver and protect the site. I can view aggregated traffic and performance information through Cloudflare.</p>
        <p>If Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled, it is used for privacy-focused, aggregate usage measurement rather than advertising or cross-site profiling.</p>
        <p>If you choose to subscribe to Architecture Notes, your email address is handled by Buttondown. If you comment on an article, comments are provided through GitHub Discussions via Giscus. Those services process information under their own privacy terms.</p>
        <p>Questions about this site can be sent to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@kumarprashant.net">hello@kumarprashant.net</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
